   I just fixed a serious bug in "monring343.diff", my patch that lets 
monsters use certain rings. The bug doesn't affect gameplay, but it 
generates lots of spurious messages on no-teleport levels, due to my
checking "tele_restrict" before figuring out whether the monster is
actually capable of teleportation.
   So, if anyone has patched their copy with "monring343.diff", you'll
want to unpatch "monring343.v1.3.diff" and repatch with the new version
of "monring343.diff".

   This has been a public service announcement. :)

